# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.vscode/

# Environment
.env

# Data storage — real dealer/prospect PII (company names, contact emails, addresses),
# Network Connect account data, and audit history shouldn't be tracked in git. Same
# reasoning as the root .gitignore's backend/storage/*.json exclusion. Repo confirmed
# private, so this isn't urgent, but it's good practice going forward regardless.
# IMPORTANT: this only stops NEW commits from including these files — several were
# already committed in prior sessions before this .gitignore existed (dealers.json.bak,
# hub_audit.json, dealer_modules.json, feature_flags.json, dealer_contacts.json, etc.).
# Run `git rm --cached hub/storage/*.json hub/storage/*.bak*` (then commit) to actually
# untrack them going forward, and consider whether history needs scrubbing if this repo
# is ever made public. See CLAUDE.md's "DealerOS Network Connect" section.
storage/*.json
storage/*.bak*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
